-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Burning_Ammunition\" title=\"Burning Ammunition\">Burning Ammunition - 1d2</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Burning_Ammunition\" title=\"Burning Ammunition\">Burning Ammunition - 1d2</a>:</b> On Ranged Attack: 1 to 2 Fire damage.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Purifying_Quiver.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Purifying_Quiver.png/420px-Purifying_Quiver.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"250\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Purifying_Quiver.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\"><i>While using this quiver, your ranged weapons will burn with enchanted flames.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background-color:#EEBBEE\">Notes\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background-color:#F0E4F0\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816184503\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.074 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.114 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2003/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11992/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2516/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion d